- op: discuss  # 3811
  at: '2026-02-27T00:43:25Z'  # 3811
  by: agent  # 3811
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 3811
  clock: 2  # 3811
  nonce: '3811'  # 3811
  message: "Bakeoff cohort 7: tmux 36% orphans, guacamole-server 40%. Root cause: function declarations in .h files and definitions in .c files produce separate Symbol objects with different IDs. register_symbol prefers .c definitions for call resolution, but declarations remain in the IR as orphan nodes. Fix options: (1) merge declaration+definition into single symbol during extraction, (2) filter declarations from output when definition exists, (3) create synthetic declaration->definition edges. Option 1 is cleanest. See deep-20260226-114957 cohort-007 diagnostics."  # 3811
