- op: discuss  # 77e8
  at: '2026-02-27T01:24:10Z'  # 77e8
  by: agent  # 77e8
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 77e8
  clock: 4  # 77e8
  nonce: '77e8'  # 77e8
  message: "Fixed in PR #1532. Filters out header declarations when .c definitions exist. register_symbol prefers definitions over declarations. Edges referencing removed declarations are remapped via _remap_edge_ids. Expected to reduce orphan rates by 15-20pp for C repos."  # 77e8
